/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k:94:  // (priority(40) preempts the generic Val rules so truthy/#loop never see a ref)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-95-  rule <k> If(ref(H:Int), T:Stmts, E:Stmts) => If(V, T, E) ... </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-96-       <heap> ... H |-> V:Val ... </heap>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-97-       [priority(40)]
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-98-  rule <k> IfExp(ref(H:Int), T:Expr, E:Expr) => IfExp(V, T, E) ... </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-99-       <heap> ... H |-> V:Val ... </heap>
