/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-101-  rule <k> ref(H:Int) ~> #whileCond(C:Expr, B:Stmts) => V ~> #whileCond(C, B) ... </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-102-       <heap> ... H |-> V:Val ... </heap>
