codex
The failure is caused by this audit sandbox’s PID/proc mismatch: Lean asks `/proc/<its PID>/exe`, but that numeric entry is absent even though `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrowly scoped runtime shim in `/tmp/audit-work` that redirects only `/proc/<number>/exe` realpath lookups to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter the frozen inputs, generated project, trusted Python checker, or Lean toolchain. I’ll record the workaround and both the failed and successful preflight attempts.
apply patch
