@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+COMMAND
+wc -l /reference/klean-generation/generated/*.lean /reference/klean-generation/generated/Klean66Digitsum/*.lean
+rg -n '^\s*(?:noncomputable\s+)?(?:theorem|lemma|example|axiom|opaque|def|inductive|structure|class)\b' /reference/klean-generation/generated --glob '*.lean'
+rg -n '\b(?:theorem|lemma|example|final|sorry|admit|unsafe|source_rule_id|obligation)\b' /reference/klean-generation/generated --glob '*.lean'
+
+RESULT SUMMARY
+Seven generated Lean files, 1310 lines total. The proof/target-token scan had
+no matches. There are no theorem, lemma, example, final, sorry, admit, unsafe,
+source_rule_id, or obligation tokens. The declarations consist of generated
+sorts/functions/rewrite constructors and exactly 41 generic collection-hook
+axioms recorded by trust-inventory.json. Klean66Digitsum/Lemmas.lean contains
+only imports, a comment, and an empty namespace. Klean66Digitsum.lean only
+imports Rewrite and Lemmas.
+
+RELEVANT GENERATED DEFINITIONS
+Klean66Digitsum/Func.lean:88-90 defines the empty IntSeq case as some 0.
+Klean66Digitsum/Func.lean:96-118 defines isLowerC/isUpperC using the frozen
+integer ranges 97..122 and 65..90.
+Klean66Digitsum/Func.lean:122-135 structurally recurses on iCons, computes the
+same upper-and-not-lower branch, adds the code, and recurses on REST.
+Klean66Digitsum/Rewrite.lean:3-5 contains the generic Rewrites relation and the
+generated execution constructor for digitSumIS, but declares no proposition
+or proof target.
+
+EXIT CODES
+wc: 0
+declaration scan: 0
+proof/target-token scan: 0 because the command used `|| true`; actual rg had
+no matches.
